        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "fdf51aa6-5a47-5020-9a73-836fcef8d71f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Atlantic City, New Jersey; Boardwalk\n- Companies: Colony Capital\n- Hotels/Casinos: The Atlantic Club Casino Hotel; Golden Nugget; Bally's Grand; Atlantic City Hilton; ACH; Trump Plaza Hotel and Casino; Dunes Hotel and Casino\n- People: Martin Stern, Jr.\n- Organizations: Ultimate Fighting Championship\n- Events: UFC 50\n\nFacts:\n- Trump Plaza Hotel and Casino in Atlantic City, New Jersey, was designed by architect Martin Stern, Jr.\n- Trump Plaza Hotel and Casino operated from May 15, 1984, until September 16, 2014.\n- UFC 50: The War of '04 was a mixed martial arts event held by the Ultimate Fighting Championship on October 22, 2004, at Trump Plaza in Atlantic City, New Jersey.\n- The Atlantic Club Casino Hotel was formerly known as Golden Nugget, Bally's Grand, Atlantic City Hilton, and ACH.\n- The Atlantic Club Casino Hotel was a casino and hotel at the southern end of the Boardwalk in Atlantic City, New Jersey, and it was owned and operated by Colony Capital.\n- Dunes Hotel and Casino was planned to be the southernmost hotel and casino on the Boardwalk, adjacent to the Golden Nugget Hotel & Casino.\n- The Atlantic Club Casino Hotel permanently closed on January 13, 2014, at 12:01 AM.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "7c4ff636-8ac4-5752-bea7-796cbdbc7f4f",
        "text": "Page: The Atlantic Club Casino Hotel. Sentence: The Atlantic Club Casino Hotel, formerly known as Golden Nugget, Bally's Grand, Atlantic City Hilton and ACH, is a closed casino and hotel located at the southern end of the boardwalk in Atlantic City, New Jersey, owned and operated by Colony Capital.\nPage: The Atlantic Club Casino Hotel. Sentence: The Atlantic Club permanently closed on January 13, 2014, at 12:01 AM.\nPage: Trump Plaza Hotel and Casino. Sentence: Designed by architect Martin Stern, Jr., it operated from May 15, 1984 until September 16, 2014.\nPage: Dunes Hotel and Casino (Atlantic City). Sentence: It was to be the southern most hotel/casino on the Boardwalk, adjacent to the Golden Nugget Hotel & Casino.\nPage: UFC 50. Sentence: UFC 50: The War of '04 was a mixed martial arts event held by the Ultimate Fighting Championship on October 22, 2004, at the Trump Plaza in Atlantic City, New Jersey.",
